  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two spheres, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span>, are spinning with the same rotational kinetic energy. The moment of inertia of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I_{X}\"></span> and that of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I_{Y}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{angular momentum of X}}{\\textit{angular momentum of Y}}\"></span>?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{I_{X}}{I_{Y}}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{I_{Y}}{I_{X}}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{I_{X}}{I_{Y}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{I_{Y}}{I_{X}}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
